0021: GI server, R-06 and R-04's region scope. A lamp with a region box solves only the texels in its box, listed a lamp (server.giListDispatch, default on; off visits every texel and gives the same layer). Each settled solve writes the lamp's touch box (the texels its sum layer lights over 0.5/255) to the GI block; RemixBridge_GiReadTouch reads it. RemixBridge_GiQueryPoints and RemixBridge_GiReadPoints: the irradiance at up to 256 points (position, normal) from every settled layer, each lamp weighted, one dispatch (gi_solve.comp pass 3). Scene and lamp blobs with a NaN or an infinity are refused. GI block layout version 3. Test: test-gi.cmd (test_gi_device, modes lots and lots-full).
Applies after 0020 (MC-2 mesh casters) on NVIDIAGameWorks/dxvk-remix f35b86a (bridge/ only), with 0018 and 0019 before it.
